# Intents

This section will describe the Intents API overview, the request and response example.

## Overview

To directly initiate an intent, submit a request to create an intent using the [Create an Intent](https://developers.tap.company/reference/create-an-intent) endpoint. All intents are identified by unique intent\_ids. You can also retrieve an intent, cancel an intent, or retrieve a list of intents.

