# Create a Token (Network Token)

This endpoint creates a single-use Network token that securely contains the details of a card.

Network tokenization enhances payment security by replacing sensitive card data with a unique token issued by card schemes (e.g., Visa, Mastercard). This approach minimizes the risk of exposing actual card details, ensuring safer transactions for both merchants and cardholders. This process supports seamless integration with Tap’s API, facilitating efficient handling of Customer Initiated Transactions (CIT) and Merchant Initiated Transactions (MIT)

